flowchart TD
    subgraph You["You"]
        direction LR
        Phone[Telegram app]
        Browser[Browser / VS Code]
    end

    subgraph Army["agent-army - Orchestrator"]
        ArmyBot[Army Telegram Bot]
        ArmyOrch[Orchestrator<br/>create_react_agent]
        ArmyReg[Agent Registry<br/>reads config/agents/]
    end

    subgraph Factory["agent-factory - Control Plane"]
        FactoryBot[Factory Brain Bot<br/>Telegram]
        FactoryBrain[Factory Brain<br/>deep agent]
        AdminUI[Admin UI<br/>FastAPI]
        Staging[staging/agents/]
        Registry[config/agents/<br/>enabled registry]
        Approval[(Approvals<br/>SQLite)]
    end

    subgraph ATL["ai-tech-lead - Coding Specialist"]
        ATLBot[AI Tech Lead Bot<br/>Telegram]
        ATLGraph[Coding Workflow<br/>LangGraph]
        ATLBacklog[(Backlog<br/>SQLite)]
    end

    subgraph Future["Future Agents - not yet built"]
        FutureAgent[Next specialist agent<br/>designed by Factory Brain]
    end

    subgraph Shared["Shared Infrastructure"]
        KnowledgeDB[(Knowledge Store<br/>SQLite - shared)]
        CheckpointDB[(Checkpoints<br/>per-project SQLite)]
        CodingBackend[Coding Backend<br/>Codex / Claude Code]
    end

    Phone -->|any task| ArmyBot
    Phone -->|factory commands| FactoryBot
    Phone -->|coding tasks| ATLBot
    Browser --> AdminUI

    ArmyBot --> ArmyOrch
    ArmyOrch --> ArmyReg
    ArmyReg --> Registry

    ArmyOrch -->|coding task<br/>JSON subprocess| ATLGraph
    ArmyOrch -->|design agent<br/>JSON subprocess| FactoryBrain

    FactoryBot --> FactoryBrain
    FactoryBrain --> Staging
    FactoryBrain --> Approval
    Staging -->|approved + promoted| Registry
    AdminUI --> Registry

    ATLBot --> ATLGraph
    ATLGraph --> CodingBackend
    ATLGraph --> ATLBacklog

    FactoryBrain <-->|read/write| KnowledgeDB
    ArmyOrch <-->|read/write| KnowledgeDB
    ATLGraph <-->|read/write| KnowledgeDB

    FactoryBrain --- CheckpointDB
    ATLGraph --- CheckpointDB
    ArmyOrch --- CheckpointDB

    style KnowledgeDB fill:#e8f4e8,stroke:#5a9e5a
    style CheckpointDB fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e6a817
    style Registry fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6
    style Approval fill:#fce8e8,stroke:#cc4444
    style CodingBackend fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#7c3aed
